01:12:36.220 --> 01:12:36.840
Liquid Haskell.

01:12:40.280 --> 01:12:41.240
Das sind

01:12:42.000 --> 01:12:42.480
Annotationen

01:12:43.160 --> 01:12:44.240
noch, soll vielleicht mal

01:12:44.300 --> 01:12:45.040
